# Line endings are pinned rather than left to each contributor's core.autocrlf.
# This project's launchers are Windows batch and PowerShell files, and a batch
# file that arrives with LF-only endings can fail on label and control flow in
# ways that are painful to diagnose. Everything else is normalised and checked
# out with the platform default.
* text=auto
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
